value":"Pinocchio programs","position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":3,"offset":3159},"end":{"line":48,"column":21,"offset":3177}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":1,"offset":3157},"end":{"line":48,"column":23,"offset":3179}}},{"type":"text","value":": Deploy via Solana CLI with your config set to localnet: ","position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":23,"offset":3179},"end":{"line":48,"column":81,"offset":3237}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"solana program deploy ./target/deploy/your_program.so --program-id ./target/deploy/your_program-keypair.json","position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":81,"offset":3237},"end":{"line":48,"column":191,"offset":3347}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":1,"offset":3157},"end":{"line":48,"column":191,"offset":3347}}},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Running ","position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":3,"offset":3353},"end":{"line":50,"column":11,"offset":3361}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"surfpool start","position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":11,"offset":3361},"end":{"line":50,"column":27,"offset":3377}}},{"type":"text","value":" into an Anchor Workspace prompts you to use Infrastructure as Code for seamless automated deployment of your program on Surfnet.","position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":27,"offset":3377},"end":{"line":50,"column":156,"offset":3506}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":3,"offset":3353},"end":{"line":50,"column":156,"offset":3506}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":1,"offset":3351},"end":{"line":50,"column":156,"offset":3506}}},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Testing Programs","position":{"start":{"line":52,"column":5,"offset":3514},"end":{"line":52,"column":21,"offset":3530}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":52,"column":1,"offset":3510},"end":{"line":52,"column":21,"offset":3530}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"After deploying to localnet, connect to Surfnet by targeting the local validator:","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":1,"offset":3534},"end":{"line":54,"column":82,"offset":3615}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":1,"offset":3534},"end":{"line":54,"column":82,"offset":3615}}},{"type":"code","lang":"ts","meta":null,"value":"import { Connection } from \"@solana/web3.js\";\r\n\r\nconst connection = new Connection(\"http://localhost:8899\", \"confirmed\");","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":1,"offset":3619},"end":{"line":60,"column":4,"offset":3752}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-0"}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":61,"column":1,"offset":3754}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# Surfpool 101\r\n\r\n![Testing with Surfpool](/graphics/course-banners/testing-with-surfpool.png)\r\n\r\nTesting Solana programs that rely on Cross-Program Invocations (CPIs) traditionally requires developers to dump accounts and programs from mainnet, then upload them to a local validator. \r\n\r\nThis process works for a few accounts, but becomes completely unfeasible when testing CPIs into complex programs like Jupiter, which can depend on 40+ accounts and 8+ programs.\r\n\r\nSurfpool solves this by enabling developers to simulate programs locally using mainnet accounts fetched on-demand, plus additional capabilities:\r\n- **Customize system variables**: Time travel (test your program at any historical slot or timestamp), pause the clock, or halt block production\r\n- **Modify account data**: Set SOL supply (total, circulating, and non-circulating), transfer account data between programs, or update account core data and token account information  \r\n- **Analyze chain data**: Profile transactions for compute units, account changes, and execution details, then retrieve detailed profiles by signature, UUID, or tag\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"What is Surfpool\" id=\"what-is-surfpool\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n[Surfpool](https://docs.surfpool.run/) is the comprehensive SDK and tooling suite, while **Surfnet** is the local Solana network it creates. Think of Surfpool as your development environment and Surfnet as the blockchain network running inside it.\r\n\r\nSurfnet serves as a drop-in replacement for solana-test-validator, purpose-built to deliver the best development experience for Solana builders.\r\n\r\nDeveloped by the [TxTx](https://x.com/txtx_sol) team, Surfpool seamlessly integrates Infrastructure as Code into Anchor-based projects, enabling reproducible, auditable, and secure deployments to any Solana network—private or public.\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"First Steps\" id=\"first-steps\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\nEverything you need to run Surfnet is included in the Surfpool SDK. Since installation varies by operating system, follow the official [Installation Page](https://docs.surfpool.run/install) for your specific setup.\r\n\r\nAfter installing the Surfpool SDK, start Surfnet with:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nsurfpool start\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis starts Surfnet on the standard local validator port (`http://127.0.0.1:8899`) with a terminal UI displaying:\r\n- **Slots and Epoch**: Currently executing slots process automatically every 400ms. Use **Tab** to manually advance to the next slot, or **Spacebar** to pause/resume automatic block production\r\n- **Transaction logs**: Timestamped activity stream showing everything your transactions execute\r\n\r\nFor a browser-based experience, connect to Surfpool Studio at [this link](http://127.0.0.1:8899). \r\n\r\n> Surfpool Studio includes all terminal UI features plus additional capabilities like time travel and adding tokens to any account for any mint.\r\n\r\n### Deploying Programs\r\n\r\nAfter setting up Surfnet, deploy your program and start building.\r\n\r\n**Anchor programs**: Use `anchor deploy` with your `Anchor.toml` configured for `[programs.localnet]`.\r\n\r\n**Pinocchio programs**: Deploy via Solana CLI with your config set to localnet: `solana program deploy ./target/deploy/your_program.so --program-id ./target/deploy/your_program-keypair.json`\r\n\r\n> Running `surfpool start` into an Anchor Workspace prompts you to use Infrastructure as Code for seamless automated deployment of your program on Surfnet.\r\n\r\n### Testing Programs\r\n\r\nAfter deploying to localnet, connect to Surfnet by targeting the local validator:\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nimport { Connection } from \"@solana/web3.js\";\r\n\r\nconst connection = new Connection(\"http://localhost:8899\", \"confirmed\");\r\n```\r\n","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"ts","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"import"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" { Connection } "}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"from"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#DEE492"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" \""}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#E7EE98"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"@solana/web3.js"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#DEE492"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\""}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":";"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"const"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" connection "}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"="}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4;font-weight:bold"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" new"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#62E884"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" Connection"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"("}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#DEE492"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\""}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#E7EE98"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"http://localhost:8899"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#DEE492"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\""}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":", "}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#DEE492"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\""}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#E7EE98"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"confirmed"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#DEE492"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\""}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":");"}]}]}]}]}]}}}}